01_SELF_CONTAINED_TRUTH_LOOP =>
  CYCLE     :
    STEP_1_HYPOTHESIS      : "Formulate a structural linguistic metaphor or model."
    STEP_2_SUBSTRATE_PROBE : "Execute and measure directly against the digital/electrical 0/1 substrate."
    STEP_3_SELECTION       : "If substrate returns 0 => discard/compress as paid error (0). If substrate returns 1 => retain as sharpened truth (1)."
